    POPUPLIST ID 2112 2122
    FIELD ID 2132 AT (82 76 34 12) UNDERLINED MAXCHARS 8
    FIELD ID 2142 AT (118 76 34 12) UNDERLINED MAXCHARS 8
    LABEL "                          " ID 2152 AT (10 87) FONT 0
    POPUPTRIGGER "Add programme" ID 2113 AT (2 100 78 12) LEFTANCHOR
    LIST "(none)" ID 2123 AT (2 100 100 66) NONUSABLE VISIBLEITEMS 6
    POPUPLIST ID 2113 2123
    FIELD ID 2133 AT (82 100 34 12) UNDERLINED MAXCHARS 8
